<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.3 /10.2	10.6 /10.5     11.25 /11.1</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.3/10.2	 10.65 /10.55   11.15 /11.05</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.25/10.2	10.6/10.5	11.25/11.05</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.3 /10.25     10.6/10.5	11.1 /11.0</p>
<p>Solid Bank	     10.375/10.275   10.725/10.625  11.25/11.15</p>
<p>PCI			10.35/10.225    10.65/10.5     11.25/11.0</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8934</p>
